Aeneas (https://github.com/AeneasVerif/aeneas), Apache License 2.0.
  The Lean files under CatCrypt/Crypto/SecureCompilation/AeneasFront/Demo/
  named Test*.lean contain definitions copied from the Aeneas test outputs
  tests/lean/*.lean at commit b08bf81f2524ee295a8c37444893acfc9c5f4dde; each
